{"title": "Shadow Stealth", "pageid": 31722, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow_Stealth", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp/300px-Generic_Darkness.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Generic_Darkness.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Shadow Stealth</b> is a passive feature that allows its user to avoid <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attacks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a> when <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While Lightly or Heavily Obscured, this creature does not provoke opportunity attacks when they move away from a foe. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Soulhunter\" title=\"Justiciar Soulhunter\">Justiciar Soulhunter</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive provides no actual benefit, as <code>SLIPPERY_SHADOWS</code>, the condition it is supposed to apply, does not exist in the game code.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215421\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 682/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3669/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2287/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 163/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643652/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.492      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.492      1 -total\n 49.27%   15.023      1 Template:PageSeo\n 48.29%   14.725      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.54%    9.616      1 Template:SAI\n 29.67%    9.046      1 Template:Icon_link\n 28.60%    8.722      1 Template:Icon_text\n 25.21%    7.686      2 Template:Trim\n 21.71%    6.620      1 Template:Ifempty\n 12.82%    3.909      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- S